  m_Name: NPC_greetings
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC_DialogueObject
  dialogueText:
  - Why, hello there, my little adventurer!
  - Are you off to see Grandpa in the Boggy Woods?
  - You should pick up some soup on the way for him. You know how he loves his soups!
  - Oh, and I hear some big rocks have fallen on the road to the Boggy Woods...
  - But I'm sure you'll manage to find a way over them! You always find your way!
  - I love you! Say hi to grandpa for me. And please do take care out there, okay?
  - Alright! Off you go, then!
